{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23357","headline":"喜雨 · 白居易","name":"喜雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圃旱忧葵菫，农旱忧禾菽。\n人各有所私，我旱忧松竹。\n松乾竹焦死，眷眷在心目。\n洒叶溉其根，汲水劳僮仆。\n油云忽东起，凉雨凄相续。\n似面洗垢尘，如头得膏沐。\n千柯习习润，万叶欣欣绿。\n千日浇灌功，不如一霢霂。\n方知宰生灵，何异活草木。\n所以圣与贤，同心调玉烛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23357.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23357","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}